{"report": {"question": "Compare Bitcoin e Ethereum usando suas métricas de mercado e explique a diferença entre proof of work e proof of stake.", "mode": "react_agent", "status": "complete", "answer": "Segundo os dados da CoinPaprika (atualizado em 2026-11-05 00:44 UTC), o Bitcoin (BTC) está cotado a US$ 80.632,66, com variação de +4,88% nas últimas 24 horas, enquanto o Ethereum (ETH) está a US$ 2.426,11, com variação de +7,27% no mesmo período. A diferença fundamental reside na tecnologia subjacente: o Bitcoin utiliza Proof of Work (PoW), enquanto o Ethereum utiliza Proof of Stake (PoS).", "key_points": [], "findings": [{"statement": "Bitcoin (BTC): preço US$ 80.632,66", "source_tool": "get_market_data", "source_updated_at": "2026-11-05T00:44:15Z", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-05T00:46:06.287373Z"}, {"statement": "Bitcoin (BTC): variação 24h +4,88%, 7d +0,27%", "source_tool": "get_market_data", "source_updated_at": "2026-11-05T00:44:15Z", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-05T00:46:06.287373Z"}, {"statement": "Bitcoin (BTC): market cap US$ 1.621.372.250.130,00, volume 24h US$ 26.215.901.196,40", "source_tool": "get_market_data", "source_updated_at": "2026-11-05T00:44:15Z", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-05T00:46:06.287373Z"}, {"statement": "Ethereum (ETH): preço US$ 2.426,11", "source_tool": "get_market_data", "source_updated_at": "2026-11-05T00:44:15Z", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-05T00:46:14.135441Z"}, {"statement": "Ethereum (ETH): variação 24h +7,27%, 7d +4,19%", "source_tool": "get_market_data", "source_updated_at": "2026-11-05T00:44:15Z", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-05T00:46:14.135441Z"}, {"statement": "Ethereum (ETH): market cap US$ 296.444.751.293,00, volume 24h US$ 11.616.772.819,87", "source_tool": "get_market_data", "source_updated_at": "2026-11-05T00:44:15Z", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-05T00:46:14.135441Z"}], "data_sources": [{"provider": "CoinPaprika", "tool": "get_market_data", "endpoint": "/tickers/btc-bitcoin", "source_updated_at": "2026-11-05T00:44:15Z", "retrieved_at": "202